<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hentschel-tgfb-fibronectin-limb-measurement-ggh-2d-wing-bud-discrete-r2-condensations-per-compartment-stylopod-zeugopod-autopod-vs-hentschel-2004-1-2-3> a schema:PropertyValue,
