<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hentschel-tgfb-fibronectin-limb-measurement-ggh-cellular-potts-wt-micromass-condensation-index-occ-in-occ-out-vs-continuum-r-in-r-out> a schema:PropertyValue,
