    rdfs:label "GGH discrete R2-cell density vs continuum R_2 = R Hill(c_a) Pearson r (micromass, x3 lattice)" ;
    dct:description "spatial correlation between the sigma = 2 px smoothed R2-cell occupancy of the WT GGH lattice and the Fourier-upsampled continuum prechondrogenic density on the 216 x 216 lattice" ;
